==Battleground==
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**10 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Celeboodle variants supply you with oodles and oodles of money, enough to where you don't have to concern yourself with your wallet in the slightest. Just spam at least 3 cheap meatshields (everything dies in one hit anyways), [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]], as well as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] for the occasional hit on Selena. You can also cycle out [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] on occasion, but she'll usually end up dying quickly to Devil Wife Death Surges.

